# GROUND ABOVE THE GROUND, DRAWN (DESIGN_ABOVE S1): a slab of rock staged over
# the moss's heart with `--above=roof` (AboveStage), its west edge two tiles
# west of where the player starts. From above the roof covers the player (the
# section cut is S2); over the shoulder the player stands under it, and walks
# out past its edge and looks back at the rim: banded, undercut, a dark
# underside, no tile steps.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/above-roof.tour --seed=1 --place=moss --above=roof --hour=10.5 --weather=clear:0
coast calm
wait 0.6
shot 01-the-roof-from-above
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
wait 0.8
shot 02-under-the-roof with shoulder
mouse 0,-260 0.4
wait 0.8
shot 03-up-at-the-underside with shoulder
mouse 0,260 0.4
leap 1.5
wait 0.6
shot 04-out-past-its-edge with shoulder
mouse 1100,0 0.8
wait 0.8
shot 05-back-at-the-rim with shoulder
